So the pattern is: `src/**/__tests__/*.test.tsx` where the source is `src/**/Component.tsx`.

For App.tsx which is at `web/src/App.tsx`, the test should be at `web/src/__tests__/App.test.tsx`.

Let me also check the hooks test to understand mocking patterns.

